"Nilama Marina is a seaside neighborhood on F City's northwestern edge."
"Its narrow streets hold identical pastel shoebox buildings and magic-tended palm trees."
"A tattoo parlor, a clothes shop and a family zone are nearby."
"Nilama tower, a seaside apartment tower, carries a giant neon 'Nilama' sign on its roof."
"The tower has a red-tiled lobby, a revolving door and gold-doored elevators playing theremin."
"Built in the late 1900s, it is the island's only Googie-style skyscraper, with roof spikes."
"The tower is likely to be torn down; its roof can be booked for events."
"Kon and Lexi Roberts' family lives on its seventh floor, with oval windows over the marina."
"At Diwali a street near the marina closes to traffic and is covered in rangoli."
